# Debate scenes played in /faction: A opens, others take sides. Each keeps the real arguments
# players made (research brief section 7) in new words. Roles are different bots of one realm.

@kind debate
@topic buffbots
@levels 20-50
@scene buffbots
@role B type=NoLifer,Daredevil
@role C type=Socialite,Leveler
A: {q} is everyone running a buffbot on a second account now?
B: why not, buffs make solo play actually fun
C: one person running a whole group is not a group though
B: support classes are boring to level, a bot lets them stay useful
C: and it takes a spot a real healer could have had
A: fair points both. still kind of want one

@topic stealth
@levels 35-50
@scene stealthers
@role B type=Leveler,Crafter,Socialite
@role C type=NoLifer,Daredevil
A: got killed by a stealther on the way to {keep} again
B: stealthers ruin the frontier for anyone who travels alone
C: then do not travel alone. that is the whole point of them
B: easy to say when you are the one stabbing people
C: groups barely see us. we hunt the stragglers, that is the job
A: so the lesson is travel in groups. noted

@topic archers
@levels 35-50
@scene archers
@role B type=*
@role C class=Scout,Hunter,Ranger
A: archers hit from so far away it does not feel fair
C: we die the second anyone reaches us, it evens out
B: the range is the problem, you cannot close on them in the open
C: use the terrain. we need line of sight, you know
A: going to try hugging the walls next time

@topic zerg
@levels 35-50
@scene zerg
@role B type=NoLifer,Daredevil
@role C type=Socialite,Leveler
A: is zerging really rvr or just a crowd walking around?
B: small groups is where the skill is, the zerg is for the realm points
C: the zerg takes keeps. small groups take screenshots
B: a good 8man beats twenty people who do not assist
C: and twenty people still take the keep while you are busy
A: so we need both. got it

@topic relics
@levels 35-50
@scene relics
@role B type=*
@role C type=NoLifer
A: does anyone actually care who holds the relics?
B: the realm with the most people always ends up with them anyway
C: the bonus is real, every fight is easier when we hold them
B: then the other realms gang up and take them back
C: which is the most fun the frontier gets all month
A: count me in for the next relic raid

@topic darkness_falls
@levels 20-50
@scene darkness_falls
@role B type=Leveler,NoLifer
@role C type=Daredevil,Socialite
A: we lost darkness falls again
B: that hurts, the xp and the seals down there are great
C: means the frontier needs people, not the dungeon
B: keeps are boring when you could be farming demons
C: and you cannot farm demons if nobody takes the keeps
A: ok who is coming to the frontier

@topic twinks
@levels 20-24
@scene twinks
@role B type=Daredevil,NoLifer
@role C type=Leveler,Socialite
A: thidranki tonight, but the twinks are out in force
B: a twink is just someone who planned ahead
C: or someone who hit 24 and refused to grow up
B: gear matters everywhere, why not in the battleground
C: because new players get farmed and quit
A: i will bring friends then

@topic spellcraft
@levels 35-50
@scene spellcraft
@role B type=NoLifer,Crafter
@role C type=Leveler,Socialite
A: is a full spellcrafted suit worth it at 50?
B: absolutely, capped stats change everything in a fight
C: it costs a fortune and you replace pieces when you find drops
B: drops never land the stats you need, crafted does
C: play first, perfect your gear later
A: guess i start saving now

@topic crafting
@levels 1-50
@scene legendary
@role B type=Crafter
@role C type=Leveler,Daredevil
A: is grinding a craft to legendary worth it?
B: masterpiece gear sells, and nothing beats crafting your own
C: it is a money pit, you could buy everything you need
B: and who do you think makes the things you buy?
C: fair. still not spending my coin on it
A: maybe i just pick something cheap to start

@topic healer_spec
@levels 20-50
@realm mid
@scene pac_or_mend
@role B class=Healer
@role C type=*
A: {q} pac healer or mending healer for groups?
B: pac, the mez saves more groups than any heal
C: a group without heals does not live long enough to mez
B: the heals come with any spec, the mez has to be trained
C: i will take the healer who keeps me alive
A: so pac for the frontier, mend for dungeons?
@realm *

@topic solo_class
@levels 1-50
@scene best_solo
@role B type=Daredevil
@role C type=Leveler
